1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,976
ChatGPT se apne company ke kal ke
sales report ke baare mein poocho 

2
00:00:04,542 --> 00:00:07,808
wo ya to mana kar dega, ya koi
galat number bana kar de dega. 

3
00:00:08,401 --> 00:00:08,601
Kyun? 

4
00:00:09,121 --> 00:00:12,282
Kyunki har LLM ek closed-book
exam ki tarah hota hai. 

5
00:00:12,864 --> 00:00:15,857
Use sirf wahi yaad hai jo usne
training ke waqt padha tha. 

6
00:00:16,374 --> 00:00:19,287
Tumhara private ya naya data
uske paas hai hi nahi. 

7
00:00:19,874 --> 00:00:24,270
Yahin aata hai RAG —
Retrieval-Augmented Generation. 

8
00:00:24,851 --> 00:00:29,332
Simple bhasha mein: AI ko closed-book
ki jagah open-book exam dene dena. 

9
00:00:29,852 --> 00:00:31,293
Ye do hisson mein kaam karta hai.  

10
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:39,162
Pehle, tum apne PDFs, docs, aur databases ko
chhote chunks mein tod kar Vector Database mein store karte ho. 

11
00:00:39,722 --> 00:00:41,733
Ye AI ki personal library hai. 

12
00:00:42,277 --> 00:00:47,699
Jab tum sawal poochte ho, system pehle is
library se sirf relevant pages retrieve karta hai. 

13
00:00:48,195 --> 00:00:51,975
Phir un pages ko tumhare sawal ke saath
jod kar LLM ko bhejta hai,

14
00:00:52,498 --> 00:00:55,828
aur LLM exact, accurate
jawab generate karta hai.

15
00:00:56,368 --> 00:01:00,314
Na model ko mehnga re-train karne ki
zaroorat, na hallucination ka darr. 

16
00:01:00,832 --> 00:01:04,234
Bas sahi context do,
aur AI expert ban jaata hai.
